+ * process2() for anything else. isFirstBand/isLastBand each independently control the mirrored
+ * border handling at the true top/bottom of the frame; a middle band always has real image data
+ * immediately above and below it to read as "previous"/"next" line, exactly like the un-banded
+ * code reading past its start/end would, so no mirroring is needed there.
